            "review_text": "Chiến Nguyễn (Chris)\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam86 contributions\n0\nFried Chicken - Chicken Addicted\nJan 2024 • Friends\nFried Chicken with sauce is the best option when coming this place. So you can mix some favors you want. This has air-conditioner. But it is not good at chicken with cheese, in my opinion.\nThe restaurant is for chicken lovers. I find the fried chicken with a variety of sauces very delicious, but the cheese chicken pan is a bit greasy and greasy if there are few people, I think I shouldn't order it. Suitable for lunch with friends, the restaurant has cool air conditioning.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten January 11, 2024",
