            "review_title": "Review at Don Chicken",
            "review_text": "Mervyn33\nSingapore, Singapore353 contributions\n0\nDelicious Korean Chicken in HCMC\nFeb 2020 • Solo\nDecided to skid Japanese foods this round in HCMC and tried Korean Fried Chicken.\nInitially I wanted to try out bb q Chicken Premium but it was closed.\nDon Chicken was just a few metres along the same stretch, so I decided to give it a try.\nUpon entering the restaurant I was greeted with a Korean welcome .. staff were young and friendly.\nLooking through the menu, I realized beside the fried chicken they have other versions like garlic, baked chickens as well.\nI ordered a Combo 2 set, comprising a 3 pieces of fried chicken, 3 pieces of garlic chicken, fruits salad and a small portion of coleslaw. Three type of sauces accompanied the chicken.\nThe fried chicken and the garlic chicken was great. \nWould recommend anyone to try it when in HCMC.\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2020",
