            "review_text": "Kaii\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam29 contributions\n0\nVery awesome and friendly\nJan 2019 • Couples\nThis is my third time eating Don Chicken because I really like chicken here. I often come here with my girlfriend. In my opinion, the warm light looks very romantic, suitable for dating. The menu also has many other types of chicken. I have not tried everything but will in the future. Perhaps the price is quite high for the young Vietnamese but I think it is still fine because the chicken is very delicious! The staff is also good and polite.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 17, 2019",
