            "review_text": "jackson1415\nSydney, Australia20 contributions\n0\nWorst service I encountered in Thailand\nDec 2018 • Family\nChange the waitress (only one over there). She did not seem interested in the job. Black face all the time. Impatience look when asked one more question. Poor english communication.\n\nShe was the worst waitress I have ever encountered in all restaurants in Thailand. When I politely went to her cashier and wanted to ask for some ice, she was texting on her phone, I didn't say anything but waited. She was browsing some facebook news after texting, not asking what I wanted. I stood there for a few mins and then when she finished her phone, she just came out from the cashier and served beer to other customers, as if I did not exist. After serving beer, she came back and asked what I wanted, I said please gave me a glass of ice. Her face looked annoyed and turned away. I didn't know what I offence her or she was in bad mood. Anyway, I went back to my seat and she served me a glass of ice. That was my last day in Bangkok and I had a free 1,000 bhat voucher that initially I was about to give it to her, but after that, I simply dumped the voucher instead of giving it to her. She just ruined the good reputation of a restaurant. \n\nOn the other hand, fried chicken taste was pretty good. A credit to the chef.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2019",
